<p><a href="https://www.postgresql.org/about/news/postgresql-18-released-3142/">Postgres 18 just shipped</a>, and as always, it’s available in preview on Neon right away. <a href="https://console.neon.tech/signup">You can try it right now on Neon’s Free plan</a>, no credit card or setup required.</p>
